  "instructions": [
    "Heat the wok over high heat and add 1 tablespoon of olive oil.",
    "Add the panch phoron and cook for 1 minute, until fragrant.",
    "Add the garlic and cook for another minute, until softened.",
    "Add the millet and cook for 2-3 minutes, until lightly toasted.",
    "Add the Italian seasoning, salt, and black pepper, and stir to combine.",
    "Add the wok hei sauce and saltimbocca sauce, and stir to combine.",
    "Add the chopped parsley and basil, and stir to combine.",
    "Add the melted mozzarella cheese, and stir to combine.",
    "Transfer the mixture to a serving dish and garnish with fresh thyme.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy!"
